{
  "name": "dsh-deepseek-web-relay",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "description": "在 DSH 左侧边栏加一个原生菜单项「DeepSeek Relay」：点它在独立浏览器窗口里打开 chat.deepseek.com（登录态持久化，窗口已存在时切回前台）；支持双向划词互传（DSH 划词一键传给网页端输入框 / 网页端划词浮现气泡一键接力回 DSH 输入框）；网页端每条 AI 回复末尾「↪ 分支到 DSH」一键把对话上下文带进 DSH 新会话。",
  "icon": "./icon.png",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "deepseek",
    "sidebar",
    "chat",
    "relay",
    "cdp"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "page-script.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "install.ps1",
    "uninstall.ps1",
    "tools",
    "locale",
    "icon.png",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "acdsh4869",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/acdsh4869/dsh-deepseek-web-relay#readme",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/acdsh4869/dsh-deepseek-web-relay.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/acdsh4869/dsh-deepseek-web-relay/issues"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [],
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": false
    }
  }
}
